Rule 6     element -> key_or_services COLON NEWLINE
Rule 7     element -> key_or_services COLON NEWLINE INDENT block DEDENT
Rule 8     key_or_services -> KEY
Rule 9     key_or_services -> SERVICES
Rule 10    block -> block_item
Rule 11    block -> block block_item
Rule 12    block_item -> KEY COLON VALUE NEWLINE
Rule 13    block_item -> KEY COLON NEWLINE
Rule 14    block_item -> KEY COLON NEWLINE INDENT block DEDENT
Rule 15    block_item -> list_items
Rule 16    list_items -> list_item
Rule 17    list_items -> list_items list_item
Rule 18    list_item -> DASH VALUE NEWLINE
Rule 19    empty -> <empty>

Terminals, with rules where they appear

COLON                : 5 6 7 12 13 14
DASH                 : 18
DEDENT               : 7 14
INDENT               : 7 14
KEY                  : 8 12 13 14
NEWLINE              : 5 6 7 12 13 14 18
SERVICES             : 9
VALUE                : 5 12 18
error                : 

